                "text": "Even during a shutdown, Tribal communities shouldn\u2019t face uncertainty about essential care. I appreciate Secretary Kennedy\u2019s commitment to keeping the Indian Health Service operating. As Chairman of the Subcommittee on Indian and Insular Affairs, I\u2019ll keep working to ensure federal promises to Tribal nations are honored\u2014no matter the politics in Washington. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 #CO03\n\nhttps://t.co/vZvMBJmmIJ",
