                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\u201cCompromise isn\u2019t rocket science, and it shouldn\u2019t be treated like a weakness.\u201d\n\nToday, I joined @RepDonBacon, @RepTomSuozzi, and @RepJoshG in releasing bipartisan principles for extending and reforming ACA Enhanced Premium Tax Credits. This is how we lower health care costs and deliver real results for the American people.\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 #CO03",
