                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Not long ago, I had the privilege of meeting 99-year-old WWII veteran Joe Esquibel at the Grand Junction VA Medical Center here in #CO03. On this #VeteransDay, we honor Joe and countless other American heroes who have served our nation, and the families who stood beside them. Their courage, sacrifice, and devotion to freedom deserve our deepest gratitude. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
